Description: Next-Generation Security Lab, CTF, and Educational Testing Framework
 CrackMapExec+ is a modular, protocol-driven security testing framework
 engineered for authorized penetration testing labs, CTF competitions,
 and security education. It provides high-speed inspection of SMB, LDAP,
 WinRM, and SSH endpoints with rich terminal reporting.
